sequenceDiagram
    participant V as GridViewer._process
    participant G as Grid
    participant B as ComponentBehavior
    participant C as Component
    participant I as Item

    Note over V: Each frame: accumulate _timer
    V->>G: tick()  [when _timer >= tick_interval]
    activate G

    Note over G,B: Phase A — consume_phase (per component)
    G->>B: consume_phase(comp, grid)
    B->>C: clear item if output port

    Note over G,I: Snapshot — record item.from_cell
    G->>I: from_cell = comp.origin

    Note over G,B: Phase B — push_phase (multi-pass until stable)
    loop while any behavior returns true
        G->>B: push_phase(comp, grid, moved)
        B->>C: send item out next out-face if empty
        C-->>G: true if moved
    end

    Note over G,B: Phase C — emit_phase (per component)
    G->>B: emit_phase(comp, grid)
    B->>I: Item.new(material) on facing neighbor
    I->>C: land on neighbor with from_cell = port.origin

    deactivate G
    V->>V: queue_redraw()
    V->>V: _draw() 3 layers:
    Note over V: L1: bg_cells (conveyors, empty), rotated sprites
    Note over V: L2: items (lerp from_cell → origin by t)
    Note over V: L3: port_cells (overlap items → emerge look), rotated sprites